"点播支持 type 0 XML / type 1 JSON，以及配置含 spider 或 jar 的 type 3 Java / CSP 接口。CSP 在 Mac 内的独立运行时调用，视频仍在软件内播放；旧版保存的配置请先刷新一次。首次启动及 Intel 机型可能需要更长时间。具体分类、搜索和播放能力以接口返回为准。\n\n直播支持 M3U / TXT 与 TVBox lives。暂未支持 JS / Python 爬虫、type 4 远程爬虫、网页嗅探和 parses 解析服务；需要登录或专有运行库的接口可能无法使用。\n\n同一地址再次导入会更新已保存的源，收藏和播放记录保留。" = "On-demand supports type 0 XML, type 1 JSON and type 3 Java / CSP with a spider or jar configuration. CSP runs locally on your Mac; video plays inside TVBox. Refresh sources saved by older versions. First launch, especially on Intel, may take longer. Categories, search and playback depend on the API.\n\nLive TV supports M3U / TXT and TVBox lives. JS / Python crawlers, type 4, web sniffing and parses services are not supported. APIs requiring login or proprietary libraries may not work.\n\nImporting the same URL updates the saved source and preserves favorites and history.";
